https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/16126 removed the implementations of `WrappedRoundTripper() http.RoundTripper` present in all of the client transports.

This is required to allow the proxy handlers to drill down and use the Dial and TLSConfig data in the innermost http.Transport when doing upgrade requests.

