comment_text:
Behavior of the `items` field for empty lists has changed in 1.5.

With 1.4 (and earlier releases):
```
{
  "kind": "PodList",
  "apiVersion": "v1",
  "metadata": {
    "selfLink": "/api/v1/namespaces/default/pods",
    "resourceVersion": "117"
  },
  "items": []
}
```

With 1.5 and master:
```
{
  "kind": "PodList",
  "apiVersion": "v1",
  "metadata": {
    "selfLink": "/api/v1/namespaces/default/pods",
    "resourceVersion": "25"
  },
  "items":null
}
```

Looks like a re-emergence of https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/2070 / https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/2075

