RBAC registers a VersionPreferenceOrder of v1beta1, v1alpha1:
https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/master/pkg/apis/rbac/install/install.go#L41
```go
VersionPreferenceOrder: []string{v1beta1.SchemeGroupVersion.Version, v1alpha1.SchemeGroupVersion.Version},
